{"seq":2,"slug":"docs-sdk-generation","title":"文档生成与 SDK 工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/docs-sdk-generation","wordCount":999,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"文档生成与-sdk-工程\">文档生成与 SDK 工程</h1><p>API 文档不是写完后放在 Wiki 里落灰的产物——它是 API 的用户界面。2026 年的实践表明：文档从 OpenAPI Spec 自动生成、SDK 从同一份 Spec 自动构建、两者始终与实现同步，才是消除&quot;文档漂移&quot;的唯一可靠方式。当 Spec 变更时，文档和 SDK 在同一次 CI 运行中自动更新——这就是 contract-first 在消费者侧的完整闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>API 的消费者体验由三层工件构成：可交互文档（让开发者理解 API）、类型化 SDK（让开发者高效集成）、示例代码（让开发者快速上手）。三者都应该从同一份 Spec 派生。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[OpenAPI Spec] --&gt; B[交互式文档]&#10;    A --&gt; C[多语言 SDK]&#10;    A --&gt; D[示例代码]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Postman Collection]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Redoc / Scalar]&#10;    C --&gt; G[TypeScript SDK]&#10;    C --&gt; H[Python SDK]&#10;    C --&gt; I[Go SDK]\">graph LR\n    A[OpenAPI Spec] --&gt; B[交互式文档]\n    A --&gt; C[多语言 SDK]\n    A --&gt; D[示例代码]\n    A --&gt; E[Postman Collection]\n    B --&gt; F[Redoc / Scalar]\n    C --&gt; G[TypeScript SDK]\n    C --&gt; H[Python SDK]\n    C --&gt; I[Go SDK]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档方案</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Swagger UI</td>\n<td>经典三栏布局，可直接发请求</td>\n<td>内部 API、快速原型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redoc</td>\n<td>长页面排版，阅读体验优秀</td>\n<td>公共 API 文档站</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scalar</td>\n<td>现代设计，主题可定制，2026 年新秀</td>\n<td>重视品牌的 API 产品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stoplight Elements</td>\n<td>嵌入式组件，可集成到任何站点</td>\n<td>开发者门户</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从-spec-生成交互式文档\">从 Spec 生成交互式文档</h2><h3 id=\"文档的关键要素\">文档的关键要素</h3><p>一份优秀的 API 文档不只是端点列表，而是一个<strong>可导航的学习路径</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>快速开始（Quickstart）</strong> — 5 分钟从零到第一个成功调用</li>\n<li><strong>认证指南</strong> — 如何获取凭据、Token 生命周期、刷新流程</li>\n<li><strong>端点参考</strong> — 每个端点的参数、响应、示例</li>\n<li><strong>错误目录</strong> — 每个错误码的含义与修复方法</li>\n<li><strong>Changelog</strong> — 版本变更历史，破坏性变更高亮</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"examples-的重要性\">Examples 的重要性</h3><p>OpenAPI 3.1 的 <code>examples</code> 字段（复数）支持为同一端点提供多个场景的示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"responses:&#10;  &#39;200&#39;:&#10;    content:&#10;      application/json:&#10;        examples:&#10;          success_with_items:&#10;            summary: 包含商品的订单&#10;            value:&#10;              id: &#39;ord_abc123&#39;&#10;              status: &#39;confirmed&#39;&#10;              items: [{ sku: &#39;SKU-001&#39;, quantity: 2 }]&#10;          empty_order:&#10;            summary: 空订单&#10;            value:&#10;              id: &#39;ord_xyz789&#39;&#10;              status: &#39;pending&#39;&#10;              items: []\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">responses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '200'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      application/json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        examples</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          success_with_items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">包含商品的订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ord_abc123'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirmed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SKU-001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">quantity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          empty_order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">空订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ord_xyz789'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span></code></pre></div><p>好的示例比完美的 Schema 更能帮助开发者理解 API 的行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sdk-生成工具链\">SDK 生成工具链</h2><h3 id=\"openapi-generator\">OpenAPI Generator</h3><p>开源社区最大的 codegen 工具，支持 50+ 语言的 Client/Server 生成。优势是覆盖面广，劣势是生成代码的质量参差不齐——某些语言的模板不够&quot;地道&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"speakeasy\">Speakeasy</h3><p>2026 年兴起的商业 SDK 生成器，核心差异在于<strong>生成符合各语言惯例的代码</strong>——Python SDK 用 dataclass + type hints，TypeScript SDK 用 Zod 校验，Go SDK 遵循 Google 风格。</p>\n<h3 id=\"typescript-专项-从-openapi-到-tanstack-query\">TypeScript 专项：从 OpenAPI 到 TanStack Query</h3><p>对前端开发者最友好的方式是直接生成带有 TanStack Query（React Query）集成的 hooks：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 自动生成的 hook&#10;export function useGetOrder(orderId: string) {&#10;  return useQuery({&#10;    queryKey: [&#39;orders&#39;, orderId],&#10;    queryFn: () =&gt; client.orders.get(orderId),&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function useCreateOrder() {&#10;  return useMutation({&#10;    mutationFn: (data: NewOrder) =&gt; client.orders.create(data),&#10;    onSuccess: () =&gt; {&#10;      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [&#39;orders&#39;] });&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自动生成的 hook</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useGetOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, orderId],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.orders.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useCreateOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useMutation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    mutationFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NewOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.orders.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    onSuccess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      queryClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invalidateQueries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>工具如 <code>openapi-react-query</code>、<code>orval</code> 能从 Spec 直接生成这类代码，前端开发者无需手写任何 fetch 逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sdk-的设计原则\">SDK 的设计原则</h2><p>无论是手写还是生成的 SDK，优秀的 SDK 遵循以下原则：</p>\n<h3 id=\"零配置可用\">零配置可用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 不好 — 需要大量配置&#10;const client = new APIClient({&#10;  baseUrl: &#39;https://api.example.com&#39;,&#10;  version: &#39;v1&#39;,&#10;  timeout: 30000,&#10;  retries: 3,&#10;  headers: { &#39;X-Custom&#39;: &#39;value&#39; },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 好 — 最小配置即可使用&#10;const client = new APIClient({ apiKey: &#39;sk_live_xxx&#39; });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不好 — 需要大量配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> APIClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  baseUrl: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://api.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'v1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  timeout: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retries: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  headers: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'X-Custom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'value'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 好 — 最小配置即可使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> APIClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ apiKey: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sk_live_xxx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"类型安全的方法签名\">类型安全的方法签名</h3><p>SDK 的每个方法应该有明确的输入类型和返回类型，IDE 补全即文档：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface OrdersAPI {&#10;  list(params?: { status?: OrderStatus; limit?: number }): Promise&lt;PaginatedList&lt;Order&gt;&gt;;&#10;  get(id: string): Promise&lt;Order&gt;;&#10;  create(data: NewOrder): Promise&lt;Order&gt;;&#10;  update(id: string, data: Partial&lt;Order&gt;): Promise&lt;Order&gt;;&#10;  cancel(id: string, reason?: string): Promise&lt;Order&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrdersAPI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">limit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PaginatedList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NewOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Partial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  cancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"内置重试与错误处理\">内置重试与错误处理</h3><p>SDK 应该封装重试逻辑（指数退避、Retry-After 尊重）和错误类型化（让消费者 catch 到具体错误类而非泛化 Error）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"try {&#10;  const order = await client.orders.create({ ... });&#10;} catch (err) {&#10;  if (err instanceof ValidationError) {&#10;    console.log(err.fields); // 字段级错误&#10;  } else if (err instanceof RateLimitError) {&#10;    console.log(err.retryAfter); // 重试时间&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.orders.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">instanceof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ValidationError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err.fields); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 字段级错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">instanceof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RateLimitError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err.retryAfter); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重试时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"api-changelog-与破坏性变更通知\">API Changelog 与破坏性变更通知</h2><p>每次 API 发布都应生成结构化的 Changelog，特别标注破坏性变更：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 2026-07-01&#10;&#10;### Breaking Changes&#10;&#10;- `GET /orders` 响应中 `total_amount` 字段类型从 `number` 改为 `string`（支持高精度金额）&#10;&#10;### New Features&#10;&#10;- 新增 `GET /orders/{id}/timeline` 端点&#10;&#10;### Deprecations&#10;&#10;- `GET /orders?sort=date` 的 `date` 排序值已废弃，请使用 `created_at`&#10;  - 将于 2026-10-01 移除\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 2026-07-01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Breaking Changes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> `GET /orders`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 响应中 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`total_amount`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 字段类型从 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`number`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 改为 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`string`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">（支持高精度金额）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### New Features</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 新增 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`GET /orders/{id}/timeline`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 端点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Deprecations</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> `GET /orders?sort=date`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 的 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`date`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 排序值已废弃，请使用 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`created_at`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 将于 2026-10-01 移除</span></span></code></pre></div><p>自动化工具（如 <code>oasdiff</code>）能对比两个版本的 OpenAPI Spec，自动检测破坏性变更并生成 Changelog。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开发者门户的全景\">开发者门户的全景</h2><p>成熟的 API 产品将上述所有工件整合为一个开发者门户（Developer Portal）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[开发者门户] --&gt; B[交互式文档]&#10;    A --&gt; C[SDK 下载 / 包管理器安装]&#10;    A --&gt; D[API 密钥管理]&#10;    A --&gt; E[用量监控仪表盘]&#10;    A --&gt; F[Changelog + 状态页]&#10;    A --&gt; G[社区 / 工单支持]\">graph TB\n    A[开发者门户] --&gt; B[交互式文档]\n    A --&gt; C[SDK 下载 / 包管理器安装]\n    A --&gt; D[API 密钥管理]\n    A --&gt; E[用量监控仪表盘]\n    A --&gt; F[Changelog + 状态页]\n    A --&gt; G[社区 / 工单支持]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>文档从 Spec 自动生成，确保与实现永不漂移</li>\n<li>多场景 Examples 比完美 Schema 更能帮助开发者理解行为</li>\n<li>SDK 生成选择符合目标语言惯例的工具（Speakeasy &gt; OpenAPI Generator 在质量上）</li>\n<li>优秀 SDK 的三原则：零配置可用、类型安全、内置重试与错误类型化</li>\n<li>每次发布自动检测破坏性变更并生成结构化 Changelog</li>\n<li>开发者门户整合文档 + SDK + 密钥管理 + 用量监控的完整体验</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"error-design\">错误设计与状态码</a> — SDK 中错误类型化的设计基础</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../frontend/frontend-data-fetching/practice/libraries-comparison\">前端数据获取：库选型对比</a> — 前端如何选择和使用生成的 SDK/hooks</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"文档生成与 SDK 工程","id":"文档生成与-sdk-工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Spec 生成交互式文档","id":"从-spec-生成交互式文档"},{"level":3,"text":"文档的关键要素","id":"文档的关键要素"},{"level":3,"text":"Examples 的重要性","id":"examples-的重要性"},{"level":2,"text":"SDK 生成工具链","id":"sdk-生成工具链"},{"level":3,"text":"OpenAPI Generator","id":"openapi-generator"},{"level":3,"text":"Speakeasy","id":"speakeasy"},{"level":3,"text":"TypeScript 专项：从 OpenAPI 到 TanStack Query","id":"typescript-专项-从-openapi-到-tanstack-query"},{"level":2,"text":"SDK 的设计原则","id":"sdk-的设计原则"},{"level":3,"text":"零配置可用","id":"零配置可用"},{"level":3,"text":"类型安全的方法签名","id":"类型安全的方法签名"},{"level":3,"text":"内置重试与错误处理","id":"内置重试与错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"API Changelog 与破坏性变更通知","id":"api-changelog-与破坏性变更通知"},{"level":2,"text":"开发者门户的全景","id":"开发者门户的全景"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"错误设计与状态码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/error-design"},"next":{"title":"AI Agent 可调用的 API 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/ai-agent-apis"}}